<title>USA: Princeton Dental sells practice.</title>
<headline>Princeton Dental sells practice.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEVIEW, Ill. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Princeton Dental Management Corp said Thursday that, effective February 5, it sold the assets of Dental Team of Delray Beach to Richard Staller.</p>
<p>The Delray Beach practice, with 1995 revenues of about $859,135, represented about 5.1 percent of the total revenue of Princeton Dental.</p>
<p>It said the practice was sold in exchange for forgiveness of debt of about $200,000.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
